[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "♪ Take us to the Dollhouse ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "♪ Little by little"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "Let's live in the meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "-♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "-♪ What's the big surprise? ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "♪ Let's shrink right down and go inside ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "♪ Hey, Gabby ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "Oh, hi! Whoopsie."
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "I'm so glad you're here."
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "I've been making some cat-tastic creations"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "with this cool patterned tape."
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "Ta-da!"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "And for my sweet Floydy Floyd,"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "I made a colorful collar."
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "-What do you think, Floyd?"
  },
  {
    "index": 24,
    "text": "-♪ Meow, meow! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 25,
    "text": "Oh! You know what that sound means."
  },
  {
    "index": 26,
    "text": "It's time for a Dollhouse Delivery."
  },
  {
    "index": 27,
    "text": "Come on."
  },
  {
    "index": 28,
    "text": "♪ Meow, meow, meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 29,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 30,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 31,
    "text": "♪ Meow ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 32,
    "text": "I wonder what our Meow Meow Mailbox"
  },
  {
    "index": 33,
    "text": "has for us today. Let's see."
  },
  {
    "index": 34,
    "text": "Ooh! Check it out."
  },
  {
    "index": 35,
    "text": "Our Kitty Cat Surprise Box is covered"
  },
  {
    "index": 36,
    "text": "in all different patterns."
  },
  {
    "index": 37,
    "text": "Should we open it up"
  },
  {
    "index": 38,
    "text": "and see what's inside?"
  },
  {
    "index": 39,
    "text": "Let's do it."
  },
  {
    "index": 40,
    "text": "A tiny bunch of bananas,"
  },
  {
    "index": 41,
    "text": "with all different patterns on them."
  },
  {
    "index": 42,
    "text": "And what's this?"
  },
  {
    "index": 43,
    "text": "♪ Magic Bananas ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 44,
    "text": "♪ A little magic in every bite ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 45,
    "text": "Magic Bananas?"
  },
  {
    "index": 46,
    "text": "When you eat one,"
  },
  {
    "index": 47,
    "text": "something magical happens."
  },
  {
    "index": 48,
    "text": "The magic will go away"
  },
  {
    "index": 49,
    "text": "when you drink a little water."
  },
  {
    "index": 50,
    "text": "Oh, I have got to try this."
  },
  {
    "index": 51,
    "text": "I think I'll pick this one, with stripes."
  },
  {
    "index": 52,
    "text": "Let's see."
  },
  {
    "index": 53,
    "text": "Okay."
  },
  {
    "index": 54,
    "text": "Mm."
  },
  {
    "index": 55,
    "text": "It tastes yummy, but I don't feel"
  },
  {
    "index": 56,
    "text": "anything magical happening."
  },
  {
    "index": 57,
    "text": "Wait a second. Did something happen?"
  },
  {
    "index": 58,
    "text": "I'm invisible?!"
  },
  {
    "index": 59,
    "text": "This is so cool!"
  },
  {
    "index": 60,
    "text": "We have got to take these"
  },
  {
    "index": 61,
    "text": "into the Dollhouse"
  },
  {
    "index": 62,
    "text": "and show the rest of the Gabby Cats."
  },
  {
    "index": 63,
    "text": "Do you want to come"
  },
  {
    "index": 64,
    "text": "into the Dollhouse with us,"
  },
  {
    "index": 65,
    "text": "see what other magical things"
  },
  {
    "index": 66,
    "text": "these bananas can do?"
  },
  {
    "index": 67,
    "text": "Cat-tastic!"
  },
  {
    "index": 68,
    "text": "Then it's time to get tiny."
  },
  {
    "index": 69,
    "text": "♪ A pinch on my left"
  },
  {
    "index": 70,
    "text": "Pinch, pinch on my right ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 71,
    "text": "♪ Grab Pandy's hand and hold on tight! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 72,
    "text": "Yoo-hoo! I'm over here, in the kitchen."
  },
  {
    "index": 73,
    "text": "Come on in."
  },
  {
    "index": 74,
    "text": "Welcome to the Dollhouse."
  },
  {
    "index": 75,
    "text": "I'll leave the Magic Bananas here."
  },
  {
    "index": 76,
    "text": "And now it's time to find Pandy."
  },
  {
    "index": 77,
    "text": "I just got an idea."
  },
  {
    "index": 78,
    "text": "Pandy always surprises me"
  },
  {
    "index": 79,
    "text": "with a hug attack, right?"
  },
  {
    "index": 80,
    "text": "Well, what if, this time,"
  },
  {
    "index": 81,
    "text": "I surprise him"
  },
  {
    "index": 82,
    "text": "with an invisible hug attack?"
  },
  {
    "index": 83,
    "text": "He'll never see it coming."
  },
  {
    "index": 84,
    "text": "Hug atta..."
  },
  {
    "index": 85,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 86,
    "text": "Huh?"
  },
  {
    "index": 87,
    "text": "Um…"
  },
  {
    "index": 88,
    "text": "Gabby?"
  },
  {
    "index": 89,
    "text": "Huh. I see Magic Bananas,"
  },
  {
    "index": 90,
    "text": "but I don't see Gabby anywhere."
  },
  {
    "index": 91,
    "text": "Do you know where she is?"
  },
  {
    "index": 92,
    "text": "-Invisible hug attack!"
  },
  {
    "index": 93,
    "text": "-Whee!"
  },
  {
    "index": 94,
    "text": "I've never hugged anyone invisible before."
  },
  {
    "index": 95,
    "text": "Wait. I am hugging you, right, Gabby?"
  },
  {
    "index": 96,
    "text": "It's definitely me."
  },
  {
    "index": 97,
    "text": "Can't you tell by the ears?"
  },
  {
    "index": 98,
    "text": "Being invisible is fun,"
  },
  {
    "index": 99,
    "text": "but I think I'm ready"
  },
  {
    "index": 100,
    "text": "to go back to my regular Gabby self."
  },
  {
    "index": 101,
    "text": "All I need to do is drink a little water."
  },
  {
    "index": 102,
    "text": "Ah."
  },
  {
    "index": 103,
    "text": "Is this better?"
  },
  {
    "index": 104,
    "text": "Much better."
  },
  {
    "index": 105,
    "text": "It's Cakey!"
  },
  {
    "index": 106,
    "text": "Can you make me invisible now,"
  },
  {
    "index": 107,
    "text": "so I can surprise him?"
  },
  {
    "index": 108,
    "text": "That's a great idea."
  },
  {
    "index": 109,
    "text": "-This one has wavy stripes just like mine."
  },
  {
    "index": 110,
    "text": "-Thanks."
  },
  {
    "index": 111,
    "text": "Hmm. I don't feel any different."
  },
  {
    "index": 112,
    "text": "But you sure look different."
  },
  {
    "index": 113,
    "text": "Paw-esome!"
  },
  {
    "index": 114,
    "text": "Wait till Cakey sees this."
  },
  {
    "index": 115,
    "text": "Shh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 116,
    "text": "Hi, Cakey."
  },
  {
    "index": 117,
    "text": "Hiya, Gabby."
  },
  {
    "index": 118,
    "text": "I thought I heard you and Pandy."
  },
  {
    "index": 119,
    "text": "Wait. Where's Pandy?"
  },
  {
    "index": 120,
    "text": "Huh. I haven't seen him."
  },
  {
    "index": 121,
    "text": "Hello, Cakey."
  },
  {
    "index": 122,
    "text": "A kitchen ghost!"
  },
  {
    "index": 123,
    "text": "It's just me, Cakey."
  },
  {
    "index": 124,
    "text": "Invisible Pandy."
  },
  {
    "index": 125,
    "text": "Pandy? It is you!"
  },
  {
    "index": 126,
    "text": "But why are you invisible?"
  },
  {
    "index": 127,
    "text": "He ate one of our Magic Bananas."
  },
  {
    "index": 128,
    "text": "Magic Bananas?"
  },
  {
    "index": 129,
    "text": "♪ Magic Bananas ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 130,
    "text": "♪ A little magic in every bite ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 131,
    "text": "Oh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 132,
    "text": "Sorry if I scared you, Cakey."
  },
  {
    "index": 133,
    "text": "Only a little."
  },
  {
    "index": 134,
    "text": "And you just gave me a great idea"
  },
  {
    "index": 135,
    "text": "for a ghostly good snack."
  },
  {
    "index": 136,
    "text": "Kitty ghost pops!"
  },
  {
    "index": 137,
    "text": "Kitty ghost pops?"
  },
  {
    "index": 138,
    "text": "Yep. Want to help me make some?"
  },
  {
    "index": 139,
    "text": "-Oh, yeah!"
  },
  {
    "index": 140,
    "text": "-Count me in."
  },
  {
    "index": 141,
    "text": "Sprinkle-riffic!"
  },
  {
    "index": 142,
    "text": "The first thing we need"
  },
  {
    "index": 143,
    "text": "is my jiggly gelatin mixture."
  },
  {
    "index": 144,
    "text": "It's in a big blue bowl with stars on it,"
  },
  {
    "index": 145,
    "text": "in the Kitty Fridge."
  },
  {
    "index": 146,
    "text": "We'll get it."
  },
  {
    "index": 147,
    "text": "Hi, Kitty Fridge."
  },
  {
    "index": 148,
    "text": "Hmm."
  },
  {
    "index": 149,
    "text": "Where's the big blue bowl"
  },
  {
    "index": 150,
    "text": "with stars on it?"
  },
  {
    "index": 151,
    "text": "I got it."
  },
  {
    "index": 152,
    "text": "Jiggly gelatin coming in for a landing."
  },
  {
    "index": 153,
    "text": "Thank you."
  },
  {
    "index": 154,
    "text": "Now, I'm just gonna pour the gelatin"
  },
  {
    "index": 155,
    "text": "into our molds."
  },
  {
    "index": 156,
    "text": "There."
  },
  {
    "index": 157,
    "text": "Whoopsie!"
  },
  {
    "index": 158,
    "text": "-Ooh."
  },
  {
    "index": 159,
    "text": "-Invisible clean-up!"
  },
  {
    "index": 160,
    "text": "Easy-peasy, no one can see me."
  },
  {
    "index": 161,
    "text": "Now we just add our wooden sticks."
  },
  {
    "index": 162,
    "text": "And now we need one more thing."
  },
  {
    "index": 163,
    "text": "Gummy kitty ghosts."
  },
  {
    "index": 164,
    "text": "Pick your favorite one."
  },
  {
    "index": 165,
    "text": "Meow!"
  },
  {
    "index": 166,
    "text": "Follow me, kitty ghosts."
  },
  {
    "index": 167,
    "text": "Now we just pop them in the fridge"
  },
  {
    "index": 168,
    "text": "until they're ready."
  },
  {
    "index": 169,
    "text": "I'm on it."
  },
  {
    "index": 170,
    "text": "In you go."
  },
  {
    "index": 171,
    "text": "-Hey, Kitty Fridge?"
  },
  {
    "index": 172,
    "text": "-Meow?"
  },
  {
    "index": 173,
    "text": "Will you let us know"
  },
  {
    "index": 174,
    "text": "when our ghost pops are ready?"
  },
  {
    "index": 175,
    "text": "Meow, meow."
  },
  {
    "index": 176,
    "text": "Meow, meow."
  },
  {
    "index": 177,
    "text": "I'll get 'em."
  },
  {
    "index": 178,
    "text": "Thanks, Kitty Fridge."
  },
  {
    "index": 179,
    "text": "Meow, meow."
  },
  {
    "index": 180,
    "text": "Now we're in for a treat."
  },
  {
    "index": 181,
    "text": "A kitty ghost pop treat."
  },
  {
    "index": 182,
    "text": "Mm!"
  },
  {
    "index": 183,
    "text": "This is tasty."
  },
  {
    "index": 184,
    "text": "And jiggly-wiggly."
  },
  {
    "index": 185,
    "text": "Mm!"
  },
  {
    "index": 186,
    "text": "Hey, invisible Pandy,"
  },
  {
    "index": 187,
    "text": "ready for some water?"
  },
  {
    "index": 188,
    "text": "Thanks."
  },
  {
    "index": 189,
    "text": "I'm thirsty, and I'm ready"
  },
  {
    "index": 190,
    "text": "to be regular Pandy again."
  },
  {
    "index": 191,
    "text": "Ah."
  },
  {
    "index": 192,
    "text": "I'm back."
  },
  {
    "index": 193,
    "text": "Pandy! I'm so glad to see you."
  },
  {
    "index": 194,
    "text": "Ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 195,
    "text": "♪ Magic Bananas ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 196,
    "text": "♪ A little magic in every bite ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 197,
    "text": "It's the Hamster Kitties!"
  },
  {
    "index": 198,
    "text": "And they're sharing a Magic Banana."
  },
  {
    "index": 199,
    "text": "I wonder what magic is in this one?"
  },
  {
    "index": 200,
    "text": "I think we're about to find out."
  },
  {
    "index": 201,
    "text": "It turned them into balloons."
  },
  {
    "index": 202,
    "text": "I'll get 'em."
  },
  {
    "index": 203,
    "text": "Whew! Hamster Kitty balloons"
  },
  {
    "index": 204,
    "text": "are not easy to catch."
  },
  {
    "index": 205,
    "text": "Let little Cakey have a try."
  },
  {
    "index": 206,
    "text": "Sprinkle party!"
  },
  {
    "index": 207,
    "text": "Got 'em!"
  },
  {
    "index": 208,
    "text": "Works every time."
  },
  {
    "index": 209,
    "text": "Great job, Cakey."
  },
  {
    "index": 210,
    "text": "All right, Hamster Kitties,"
  },
  {
    "index": 211,
    "text": "let's get you back to the craft room."
  },
  {
    "index": 212,
    "text": "Baby Box is probably"
  },
  {
    "index": 213,
    "text": "wondering where you are."
  },
  {
    "index": 214,
    "text": "Don't forget your Magic Bananas."
  },
  {
    "index": 215,
    "text": "Thanks, Cakey."
  },
  {
    "index": 216,
    "text": "Oh, Hamster Kitties!"
  },
  {
    "index": 217,
    "text": "Now, where did"
  },
  {
    "index": 218,
    "text": "those little fluffer-nutters go?"
  },
  {
    "index": 219,
    "text": "Hey, Baby Box."
  },
  {
    "index": 220,
    "text": "Look who we found."
  },
  {
    "index": 221,
    "text": "My Hamster Kitties!"
  },
  {
    "index": 222,
    "text": "I'm so glad they're back."
  },
  {
    "index": 223,
    "text": "But why are they balloons?"
  },
  {
    "index": 224,
    "text": "They ate one of our Magic Bananas."
  },
  {
    "index": 225,
    "text": "Magic Bananas?"
  },
  {
    "index": 226,
    "text": "♪ Magic Bananas ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 227,
    "text": "♪ A little magic in every bite ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 228,
    "text": "That explains everything."
  },
  {
    "index": 229,
    "text": "They're pretty cute balloons."
  },
  {
    "index": 230,
    "text": "But are they gonna stay this way forever?"
  },
  {
    "index": 231,
    "text": "Don't worry, Baby Box."
  },
  {
    "index": 232,
    "text": "All they need is a drink of water,"
  },
  {
    "index": 233,
    "text": "and they'll be back to"
  },
  {
    "index": 234,
    "text": "their old Hamster Kitty selves."
  },
  {
    "index": 235,
    "text": "Ta-da! One Hamster Kitty water bottle."
  },
  {
    "index": 236,
    "text": "Thanks, Baby Box."
  },
  {
    "index": 237,
    "text": "-Some water for you."
  },
  {
    "index": 238,
    "text": "-Mm!"
  },
  {
    "index": 239,
    "text": "Some water for you."
  },
  {
    "index": 240,
    "text": "And…"
  },
  {
    "index": 241,
    "text": "Oh, you're a thirsty one."
  },
  {
    "index": 242,
    "text": "Yay!"
  },
  {
    "index": 243,
    "text": "That was a-meow-zing!"
  },
  {
    "index": 244,
    "text": "They don't call them"
  },
  {
    "index": 245,
    "text": "Magic Bananas for nothing."
  },
  {
    "index": 246,
    "text": "I love magic."
  },
  {
    "index": 247,
    "text": "I've just got to try one of these things."
  },
  {
    "index": 248,
    "text": "Let's see."
  },
  {
    "index": 249,
    "text": "I'll try this one."
  },
  {
    "index": 250,
    "text": "I like the glowing neon colors."
  },
  {
    "index": 251,
    "text": "Mm! That's a good banana."
  },
  {
    "index": 252,
    "text": "Did something magic happen?"
  },
  {
    "index": 253,
    "text": "I'm glowing!"
  },
  {
    "index": 254,
    "text": "Doodles and doodads! I love it!"
  },
  {
    "index": 255,
    "text": "Wow! Baby Box!"
  },
  {
    "index": 256,
    "text": "You look… glow-mazing."
  },
  {
    "index": 257,
    "text": "You can't go wrong with neon."
  },
  {
    "index": 258,
    "text": "Hey, that reminds me."
  },
  {
    "index": 259,
    "text": "I know a crafty-riffic project we can do"
  },
  {
    "index": 260,
    "text": "that's all about neon."
  },
  {
    "index": 261,
    "text": "We can make…"
  },
  {
    "index": 262,
    "text": "Neon water doodles!"
  },
  {
    "index": 263,
    "text": "-Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 264,
    "text": "-Paw-esome!"
  },
  {
    "index": 265,
    "text": "Want me to show you how to make them?"
  },
  {
    "index": 266,
    "text": "Definitely."
  },
  {
    "index": 267,
    "text": "Let's give it a go."
  },
  {
    "index": 268,
    "text": "Then let's get crafting."
  },
  {
    "index": 269,
    "text": "Here's what you need."
  },
  {
    "index": 270,
    "text": "A big bowl of water."
  },
  {
    "index": 271,
    "text": "Neon dry-erase markers."
  },
  {
    "index": 272,
    "text": "And some big spoons."
  },
  {
    "index": 273,
    "text": "Wait. We're doing art with spoons?"
  },
  {
    "index": 274,
    "text": "Yep! You're gonna love it."
  },
  {
    "index": 275,
    "text": "Just follow me."
  },
  {
    "index": 276,
    "text": "First, use your marker to draw a picture"
  },
  {
    "index": 277,
    "text": "on the back of your spoon."
  },
  {
    "index": 278,
    "text": "Hmm. What should I draw?"
  },
  {
    "index": 279,
    "text": "Ooh! Good idea."
  },
  {
    "index": 280,
    "text": "Ta-da!"
  },
  {
    "index": 281,
    "text": "I made a neon-green alien."
  },
  {
    "index": 282,
    "text": "Hello, earthlings."
  },
  {
    "index": 283,
    "text": "What are you drawing, Gabby?"
  },
  {
    "index": 284,
    "text": "A heart kitty."
  },
  {
    "index": 285,
    "text": "Aww!"
  },
  {
    "index": 286,
    "text": "Crafty-riffic job, everyone."
  },
  {
    "index": 287,
    "text": "Now,"
  },
  {
    "index": 288,
    "text": "just dunk your spoon in the water,"
  },
  {
    "index": 289,
    "text": "then watch them float."
  },
  {
    "index": 290,
    "text": "My little alien is dancing."
  },
  {
    "index": 291,
    "text": "Aww! My kitty heart is holding hands"
  },
  {
    "index": 292,
    "text": "with the Hamster Kitty."
  },
  {
    "index": 293,
    "text": "Pretty doodle-tastic, huh?"
  },
  {
    "index": 294,
    "text": "And there's one more thing you could do."
  },
  {
    "index": 295,
    "text": "Use a piece of paper to catch your doodle."
  },
  {
    "index": 296,
    "text": "And when you press it onto something…"
  },
  {
    "index": 297,
    "text": "It sticks!"
  },
  {
    "index": 298,
    "text": "Wow!"
  },
  {
    "index": 299,
    "text": "I have room for a few more."
  },
  {
    "index": 300,
    "text": "That tickles."
  },
  {
    "index": 301,
    "text": "Neon-tastic, huh?"
  },
  {
    "index": 302,
    "text": "Hey, everyone. What's going on in…"
  },
  {
    "index": 303,
    "text": "Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 304,
    "text": "Baby Box, who turned on the neon?"
  },
  {
    "index": 305,
    "text": "It was the Magic Banana. It made me glow."
  },
  {
    "index": 306,
    "text": "I'm sorry."
  },
  {
    "index": 307,
    "text": "-Did you say \"Magic Banana\"?"
  },
  {
    "index": 308,
    "text": "-Yep."
  },
  {
    "index": 309,
    "text": "We've got two left."
  },
  {
    "index": 310,
    "text": "♪ Magic Bananas ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 311,
    "text": "♪ A little magic in every bite ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 312,
    "text": "Huh. What kind of magic"
  },
  {
    "index": 313,
    "text": "do these things have?"
  },
  {
    "index": 314,
    "text": "So far, they made me and Gabby invisible."
  },
  {
    "index": 315,
    "text": "They made me glow."
  },
  {
    "index": 316,
    "text": "And they made the Hamster Kitties"
  },
  {
    "index": 317,
    "text": "float like balloons."
  },
  {
    "index": 318,
    "text": "Well, then the CatRat has got to try one."
  },
  {
    "index": 319,
    "text": "Now, let's see here."
  },
  {
    "index": 320,
    "text": "♪ One banana, two banana ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 321,
    "text": "♪ Both bananas shiny ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 322,
    "text": "♪ This banana, that banana ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 323,
    "text": "♪ Which banana's mine-y? ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 324,
    "text": "This one."
  },
  {
    "index": 325,
    "text": "Cat-tastic choice, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 326,
    "text": "Thanks."
  },
  {
    "index": 327,
    "text": "Now, stand back and watch the magic."
  },
  {
    "index": 328,
    "text": "Ah…"
  },
  {
    "index": 329,
    "text": "Oh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 330,
    "text": "It flew out the window!"
  },
  {
    "index": 331,
    "text": "Look. There it is."
  },
  {
    "index": 332,
    "text": "With Floyd!"
  },
  {
    "index": 333,
    "text": "Please don't eat my banana."
  },
  {
    "index": 334,
    "text": "Please don't eat my banana."
  },
  {
    "index": 335,
    "text": "Please don't eat my banana. Please…"
  },
  {
    "index": 336,
    "text": "He ate my banana!"
  },
  {
    "index": 337,
    "text": "Sorry, CatRat. Are you okay, Floyd?"
  },
  {
    "index": 338,
    "text": "Another Floyd?"
  },
  {
    "index": 339,
    "text": "And another!"
  },
  {
    "index": 340,
    "text": "And another!"
  },
  {
    "index": 341,
    "text": "And another! And another!"
  },
  {
    "index": 342,
    "text": "It's a Floyd fiesta out there."
  },
  {
    "index": 343,
    "text": "Aww!"
  },
  {
    "index": 344,
    "text": "Look at all those cute Floyds."
  },
  {
    "index": 345,
    "text": "But I really like having"
  },
  {
    "index": 346,
    "text": "my one and only original Floyd."
  },
  {
    "index": 347,
    "text": "Then let's get out there"
  },
  {
    "index": 348,
    "text": "and get Floyd some water."
  },
  {
    "index": 349,
    "text": "And how are we gonna do that?"
  },
  {
    "index": 350,
    "text": "You can take my hot-air balloon."
  },
  {
    "index": 351,
    "text": "Thanks, Baby Box."
  },
  {
    "index": 352,
    "text": "Good luck."
  },
  {
    "index": 353,
    "text": "Wahoo!"
  },
  {
    "index": 354,
    "text": "Okay, here's the water bowl."
  },
  {
    "index": 355,
    "text": "To turn all these kitties back"
  },
  {
    "index": 356,
    "text": "to just our one and only Floyd,"
  },
  {
    "index": 357,
    "text": "we need him to drink some of this water."
  },
  {
    "index": 358,
    "text": "But how do we figure out"
  },
  {
    "index": 359,
    "text": "which one is the real Floyd?"
  },
  {
    "index": 360,
    "text": "Leave that to the CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 361,
    "text": "Ha-cha!"
  },
  {
    "index": 362,
    "text": "Oh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 363,
    "text": "Pardon me, sir."
  },
  {
    "index": 364,
    "text": "My friends and I were wondering,"
  },
  {
    "index": 365,
    "text": "are you the real Floyd?"
  },
  {
    "index": 366,
    "text": "Wait! Whoa!"
  },
  {
    "index": 367,
    "text": "CatRat!"
  },
  {
    "index": 368,
    "text": "-Phew!"
  },
  {
    "index": 369,
    "text": "-Are you okay?"
  },
  {
    "index": 370,
    "text": "I'm okay, but…"
  },
  {
    "index": 371,
    "text": "…I think we need a new plan."
  },
  {
    "index": 372,
    "text": "Oh, what do we do, Gabby?"
  },
  {
    "index": 373,
    "text": "We still don't know"
  },
  {
    "index": 374,
    "text": "which Floyd is the real Floyd."
  },
  {
    "index": 375,
    "text": "We don't know… yet."
  },
  {
    "index": 376,
    "text": "But let's think."
  },
  {
    "index": 377,
    "text": "Hmm."
  },
  {
    "index": 378,
    "text": "Aha!"
  },
  {
    "index": 379,
    "text": "Remember how I made these stripes"
  },
  {
    "index": 380,
    "text": "with colorful tape?"
  },
  {
    "index": 381,
    "text": "And remember"
  },
  {
    "index": 382,
    "text": "I made something else for Floyd?"
  },
  {
    "index": 383,
    "text": "His colorful collar."
  },
  {
    "index": 384,
    "text": "So, the real Floyd is"
  },
  {
    "index": 385,
    "text": "the only one wearing a colorful collar."
  },
  {
    "index": 386,
    "text": "What are we waiting for?"
  },
  {
    "index": 387,
    "text": "Hop in!"
  },
  {
    "index": 388,
    "text": "Let's go find Floyd."
  },
  {
    "index": 389,
    "text": "Help us look."
  },
  {
    "index": 390,
    "text": "Tell me when you see Floyd"
  },
  {
    "index": 391,
    "text": "wearing a colorful collar."
  },
  {
    "index": 392,
    "text": "There he is."
  },
  {
    "index": 393,
    "text": "You found the real Floyd."
  },
  {
    "index": 394,
    "text": "Here, kitty, kitty."
  },
  {
    "index": 395,
    "text": "Look what we got."
  },
  {
    "index": 396,
    "text": "He's drinking!"
  },
  {
    "index": 397,
    "text": "-Yes!"
  },
  {
    "index": 398,
    "text": "-And look."
  },
  {
    "index": 399,
    "text": "The magic is going away."
  },
  {
    "index": 400,
    "text": "-That's a-meow-zing!"
  },
  {
    "index": 401,
    "text": "-Bye, Floyds."
  },
  {
    "index": 402,
    "text": "We're back to just the one and only Floyd."
  },
  {
    "index": 403,
    "text": "And he's the only Floyd I need."
  },
  {
    "index": 404,
    "text": "Right, Floyd?"
  },
  {
    "index": 405,
    "text": "Well, I guess that's a happy ending,"
  },
  {
    "index": 406,
    "text": "for everyone except the CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 407,
    "text": "What's the matter, CatRat?"
  },
  {
    "index": 408,
    "text": "I never got my Magic Banana."
  },
  {
    "index": 409,
    "text": "Well, there's still one left."
  },
  {
    "index": 410,
    "text": "♪ Magic Bananas ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 411,
    "text": "♪ A little magic in every bite ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 412,
    "text": "I love that song."
  },
  {
    "index": 413,
    "text": "Go for it, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 414,
    "text": "Mm!"
  },
  {
    "index": 415,
    "text": "Tastes like…"
  },
  {
    "index": 416,
    "text": "Banana."
  },
  {
    "index": 417,
    "text": "Paw-esome!"
  },
  {
    "index": 418,
    "text": "Did something magic happen?"
  },
  {
    "index": 419,
    "text": "I'm huge! Look at me."
  },
  {
    "index": 420,
    "text": "Ha-cha!"
  },
  {
    "index": 421,
    "text": "Ooh, comfy. A cat could get used to this."
  },
  {
    "index": 422,
    "text": "You don't mind if I coodle in,"
  },
  {
    "index": 423,
    "text": "do you, Gabby?"
  },
  {
    "index": 424,
    "text": "Make yourself at home, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 425,
    "text": "Oh, yeah."
  },
  {
    "index": 426,
    "text": "This is the big life."
  },
  {
    "index": 427,
    "text": "Thanks for playing"
  },
  {
    "index": 428,
    "text": "in the Dollhouse with us today."
  },
  {
    "index": 429,
    "text": "Are you ready for one more surprise?"
  },
  {
    "index": 430,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 431,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 432,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 433,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 434,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat"
  },
  {
    "index": 435,
    "text": "Gabby Cat, Gabby Cat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 436,
    "text": "♪ Gabby Cat of the Day! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 437,
    "text": "It's me, Pandy."
  },
  {
    "index": 438,
    "text": "Do you like snacks?"
  },
  {
    "index": 439,
    "text": "You're gonna love this song."
  },
  {
    "index": 440,
    "text": "Yum, yum!"
  },
  {
    "index": 441,
    "text": "This is an ode to all my favorite snacks."
  },
  {
    "index": 442,
    "text": "See how many you know. Let's go!"
  },
  {
    "index": 443,
    "text": "♪ Apples, bananas, and berries ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 444,
    "text": "♪ Cucumbers, grapes, and cherries ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 445,
    "text": "♪ Mix 'em up all together in a smoothie ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 446,
    "text": "♪ Or one by one if you're choosy ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 447,
    "text": "♪ Take a pickle and pop it in a sandwich ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 448,
    "text": "♪ Like magic, I make snacks vanish ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 449,
    "text": "♪ So many flavors ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 450,
    "text": "♪ So many treats ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 451,
    "text": "♪ So many Pandy-licious things to eat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 452,
    "text": "Mm!"
  },
  {
    "index": 453,
    "text": "♪ I got a snacky in my packy"
  },
  {
    "index": 454,
    "text": "Yum, yum, yum! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 455,
    "text": "♪ I got a snacky in my packy"
  },
  {
    "index": 456,
    "text": "Yum, yum, yum! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 457,
    "text": "-♪ I got a snacky in my packy ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 458,
    "text": "-♪ Ooh! Ah! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 459,
    "text": "♪ If you're feeling snacky"
  },
  {
    "index": 460,
    "text": "I can give you some ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 461,
    "text": "♪ It's my favorite thing to do ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 462,
    "text": "♪ Ooh-ooh, ooh-ooh-ooh ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 463,
    "text": "♪ I bet you love snacking too ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 464,
    "text": "♪ Ooh-ooh, ooh-ooh-ooh ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 465,
    "text": "Mm! There's almost too many to name,"
  },
  {
    "index": 466,
    "text": "but I'll keep going."
  },
  {
    "index": 467,
    "text": "♪ Sardine ice cream, have you tried it? ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 468,
    "text": "♪ Hey, you never know"
  },
  {
    "index": 469,
    "text": "You might just like it ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 470,
    "text": "♪ How about a cookie"
  },
  {
    "index": 471,
    "text": "With a little bit of cheese? ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 472,
    "text": "♪ And sprinkle some granola, please ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 473,
    "text": "♪ Any combo, never say never ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 474,
    "text": "♪ Mixing it up makes snack time better ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 475,
    "text": "♪ So many flavors, so many treats ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 476,
    "text": "♪ So many Pandy-licious things to eat ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 477,
    "text": "Yum!"
  },
  {
    "index": 478,
    "text": "♪ I got a snacky in my packy"
  },
  {
    "index": 479,
    "text": "Yum-yum-yum! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 480,
    "text": "♪ I got a snacky in my packy"
  },
  {
    "index": 481,
    "text": "Yum-yum-yum! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 482,
    "text": "-♪ I got a snacky in my packy ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 483,
    "text": "-♪ Ooh! Ah! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 484,
    "text": "♪ If you're feeling snacky"
  },
  {
    "index": 485,
    "text": "I can give you some ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 486,
    "text": "♪ It's my favorite thing to do ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 487,
    "text": "♪ Ooh-ooh, ooh-ooh-ooh ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 488,
    "text": "♪ I bet you love snacking too ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 489,
    "text": "Let me hear ya!"
  },
  {
    "index": 490,
    "text": "♪ I got a snacky in my packy"
  },
  {
    "index": 491,
    "text": "Yum, yum, yum! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 492,
    "text": "♪ I got a snacky in my packy"
  },
  {
    "index": 493,
    "text": "Yum, yum, yum! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 494,
    "text": "-♪ I got a snacky in my packy ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 495,
    "text": "-♪ Ooh! Ah! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 496,
    "text": "♪ If you're feeling kind of snacky"
  },
  {
    "index": 497,
    "text": "I can give you some ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 498,
    "text": "♪ It's my favorite thing to do ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 499,
    "text": "♪ Ooh-ooh, ooh-ooh-ooh ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 500,
    "text": "♪ I bet you love snacking too ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 501,
    "text": "♪ Ooh-ooh, ooh-ooh-ooh ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 502,
    "text": "I sure do love snacking with you."
  },
  {
    "index": 503,
    "text": "Today was totally bananas,"
  },
  {
    "index": 504,
    "text": "and also kind of magical."
  },
  {
    "index": 505,
    "text": "Uh, speaking of magic…"
  },
  {
    "index": 506,
    "text": "Being giant is fun and all,"
  },
  {
    "index": 507,
    "text": "but I think I'm ready"
  },
  {
    "index": 508,
    "text": "to go back to being a regular CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 509,
    "text": "Okay, CatRat."
  },
  {
    "index": 510,
    "text": "Want me to get you a glass of water?"
  },
  {
    "index": 511,
    "text": "I'll get it."
  },
  {
    "index": 512,
    "text": "Kitchen's this way, right?"
  },
  {
    "index": 513,
    "text": "Ooh!"
  },
  {
    "index": 514,
    "text": "Ah."
  },
  {
    "index": 515,
    "text": "Everything okay, CatRat?"
  },
  {
    "index": 516,
    "text": "Yeah. I had a glass of water, and…"
  },
  {
    "index": 517,
    "text": "Mm!"
  },
  {
    "index": 518,
    "text": "…found myself a cookie."
  },
  {
    "index": 519,
    "text": "♪ Doo-doo-doo! ♪"
  },
  {
    "index": 520,
    "text": "Come back next time, and we'll open up"
  },
  {
    "index": 521,
    "text": "another Dollhouse Surprise."
  },
  {
    "index": 522,
    "text": "Bye!"
  }
]